  m_text: "CONTROLS (SIMULATOR)\n\n\u2022 W / A / S / D: Move\n\n\u2022 Q / E: Move Head Down / Up\n\n\u2022 Mouse Move: Look around\n\n\u2022 [ / ]: Select Left / Right Hand\n\n\u2022 Tab: Toggle hands moving with head\n\n\u2022 F: Teleport (Right Hand)\n\n\u2022 G: Grab / Hold object (Left Hand)\n\nOBJECTIVE: ROOM 1\n\nYou are locked inside the bedroom. Search the room thoroughly to find the hidden key and unlock the door to the next chamber.\n\n(Hint: The key is black.)"
